{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Haggle Battle</strong> is a <strong>Pawn Shop Simulator</strong> with <strong>turn based showdowns</strong> around items negotiation!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As heir to a family shop, each customer becomes a strategic negotiation battle. Execute perfect &quot;attacks&quot; to bend prices your way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build your Items Index</strong>,\u00a0every successful haggle adds unique treasures to your collection. But <strong>rent hits daily</strong>: balance cash for bills against inventory investment. Overextend and face insolvency; play safe and miss opportunities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Can you keep the family legacy alive?</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udee0\ufe0f Features</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u2022 Turn-Based Negotiation Battles \u2694\ufe0f</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face off one-on-one with customers in tense, strategic pricing duels. Choose your &quot;attacks&quot;\u2014discounts, persuasive pitches, and more\u2014to tip the deal in your favor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4049600/extras/ba532f24e32fbb259b19c60a23afd3e1.poster.avif?t=1758979858\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4049600/extras/ba532f24e32fbb259b19c60a23afd3e1.webm?t=1758979858\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4049600/extras/ba532f24e32fbb259b19c60a23afd3e1.mp4?t=1758979858\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u2022 Items Index Collection System \ud83e\udde9</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Track your negotiation history in a growing Items Index. Complete the catalog to unlock bragging rights (and maybe some  business secrets?).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4049600/extras/890935c8c3fc83cbad8748a306f7c041.poster.avif?t=1758979858\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4049600/extras/890935c8c3fc83cbad8748a306f7c041.webm?t=1758979858\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4049600/extras/890935c8c3fc83cbad8748a306f7c041.mp4?t=1758979858\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u2022 Tight Financial Strategy \ud83d\udcc8</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pay rent and utilities while making enough profits to stock new, valuable goods. Financial mismanagement could bankrupt your legacy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4049600/extras/cde0f775971191bdb014eee8840ec2ce.poster.avif?t=1758979858\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4049600/extras/cde0f775971191bdb014eee8840ec2ce.webm?t=1758979858\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4049600/extras/cde0f775971191bdb014eee8840ec2ce.mp4?t=1758979858\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u2022 Family Legacy &amp; Golden Deals</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Preserve your family\u2019s pawn shop legacy by making smart deals, clever investments, and becoming known as the savviest shop in town.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you love <strong>strategy, high-stakes bargaining, and treasure hunting under pressure</strong>, your pawn shop awaits!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >--------------------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>HaggleBattle Demo - What's Included:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DEMO CONTENT:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Complete interactive tutorial covering all <strong>core mechanics</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 <strong>3 full business</strong> days of pawn shop <strong>gameplay</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 <strong>12 unique items</strong> to discover and catalog in your Items Index</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Face multiple customers in <strong>strategic negotiation battles</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DEMO LIMITATIONS:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Limited to <strong>3 days</strong> (full game: unlimited gameplay)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 <strong>12 items</strong> maximum (full game: extensive catalog)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Progress <strong>does not carry</strong> over to full game </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the complete HaggleBattle negotiation system in this substantial demo that showcases all core gameplay mechanics while giving you a taste of running your inherited pawn shop business.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4049600?t=1758979858","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4049600?t=1758979858","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4049600/d34e2841b0835139239bd79cc393ccf29cde9203/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758979858","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4049600/d34e2841b0835139239bd79cc393ccf29cde9203/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758979858","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><s